{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は夕方から\nひめちゃんと生田さんと3人で\nBUBKAさんに取材を\nして頂きました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと！取材内容は、\nスラムダンク！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな会話になってるのか\nどんな写真になってるのかは\n発売されてからの秘密ですが\nとにかくスラムダンクは熱いことが\nわかりました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スラムダンクも熱いけど\nスラムダンクを読んだひとが\nスラムダンクを語るのも熱い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売は9月30日です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おたのしみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/07/5983128/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/07/5983128/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/07/5983128/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/07/5983128/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなつさんとは\nいつもこんなかんじ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1枚目、2枚目、3枚目\nってかんじのやりとり♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/07/5983128/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達が沖縄に友達と遊びに行ってると\n聞いてすぐにメールしました(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「沖縄」って文字だけを15回\nメールしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私とも今度行こうね！北海道！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ沖縄ではないところが\n私のちょっとの反抗(｡・・｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道に帰りたいっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族とも友達ともメンバーとも\n皆さんとも\n当たり前に会える人と\nあしたは当たり前に会えるかわからなくて\nそんなことも考えずに\nばいばいしておやすみなさいして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日当たり前にある\nばいばいとかおやすみなさいとか\n簡単にこなして当たり前に過ぎてるけど\nもしあした会えないってわかってたら\nこんなに簡単なことじゃないね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しいな～人って難しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、人が難しいのか\n当たり前なことが難しいのか\nわからない！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"祖父母や親戚に会いに行かなきゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"従姉妹のお姉ちゃんとも\nもうたぶん10年くらい会ってない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"従兄弟のお兄ちゃんと\n年下組には会ってるんだけど！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スラムダンクの名言をきいたり\n読んでる小説を読み終えて\n感じたことでまた、考えることが増えた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、新しい小説を今日買ってきて\nこれから眠くなるまで読んで寝ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読み終えたあとに自分はどう感じてるのかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！そうだ！\n最近ね、ツボが浅いの！笑いのツボ！\nあと笑い方が変になってきた！\n気をつけなくては！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/07/5983128/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}